                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Shown on a playing track (green, diffused). Fill pixels sit at the uniform fill level (110 of 255), like the Song queue fill; each leading pixel blends so the edges move smoothly. On a pill already red (recording, or any red state) its own red drops to about a third and the fill is drawn at full brightness. The flash runs on the board's clock (PILL_CLEAR_FLASHES 3, PILL_CLEAR_FLASH_MS 120); a new hold on that pill takes over."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
